        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "if(@transparentBg, transparent, @bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "& when (@autoSize)": {
                "height": "100%",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "& when (@showCardTitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showCardSubtitle)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showText)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                },
                "& when (@showButtons)": {
                  "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
                  "object-fit": "cover"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".item": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".item": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@spacing)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin-left": "0",
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              ".item": {
                "padding": "0",
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".item-content": {
              "margin-top": "2rem",
              "padding": "0 2.25rem 2.25rem",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "padding-top": "1rem",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "padding-top": "1rem",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              },
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "height": "100%"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "background": "@cardsBg",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap",
              ".item-footer": {
                "margin-top": "auto"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "pricing02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"pricing02\" group=\"Pricing\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showmainButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Price\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" parallax name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentBg\" condition=\"bg.type === 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Stock Market Trading &amp; Investing – Educational Courses</b></h4>\n                    <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .mbr-section-head .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n                    </h5>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center item-footer mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showmainButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                        <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-561x396.jpg\" alt>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Basic Technical Analysis (Educational Module)</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b>&nbsp;12549</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Introduction to Stock Market - </b>Overview of Indian stock market - History of Indian stock market - Types of stocks and exchanges (BSE, NSE, MCX) - Stock market indices (Sensex, Nifty, Nifty 50) \n<br><b>Module 2: Understanding Stocks - \n</b><br>What is a stock? - Types of stocks (equity, preference, dividend) - Stock pricing and valuation - Face value, market value, and book value \n<br><b>Module 3: Getting Started -</b> <br>Opening a demat and trading account - Understanding brokerage and commissions - Placing orders (buy, sell, limit, stop-loss) - Understanding margin and leverage\n<br><b>Module 4: Market Analysis -</b> Fundamental analysis (financial statements, ratios) - Technical analysis (charts, patterns, indicators) - News and market sentiment - Economic indicators (GDP, inflation, interest rates) \n<br><b>Module 5: Investment Options -</b> <br>Stocks (large-cap, mid-cap, small-cap) - Mutual funds (equity, debt, balanced) - Exchange-traded funds (ETFs) - Index funds - Sectoral funds \n<br><b>Module 6: Risk Management -</b> Understanding risk and reward - Diversification and asset allocation - Stop-loss and hedging strategies - Risk management techniques (insurance, derivatives)\n<br><b>Module 7: Market Trends and Indices</b>&nbsp;- Understanding bull and bear markets - Sensex and Nifty indices - Sectoral trends and analysis - Index funds and ETFs&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><b>Module 8: Company Analysis -</b> Financial statement analysis (balance sheet, income statement) - Ratio analysis (P/E, P/B, dividend yield) - Industry and market analysis - Company valuation methods \n<br><b>Module 9: Trading Strategies -</b> Day trading and swing trading - Long-term investing and value investing - News-based trading and event-driven trading - Technical analysis strategies \n<br><b>Module 10: Basic&nbsp; Options -</b> Options and futures trading - Futures and options strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Portfolio Management -</b> Portfolio construction and management - Asset allocation and diversification - Performance measurement and evaluation - Portfolio rebalancing and optimization \n<br><b>Module 12: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-561x374.jpg\" alt data-slide-to=\"2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Intermediate Technical Analysis (Educational Module)</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b>&nbsp;24989</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Advanced Stock Market Concepts -</b><br>Market capitalization and liquidity - Market efficiency and randomness - Risk and return analysis&nbsp;<br><b>Module 2: Technical Analysis -</b> Chart patterns (candlesticks, trends) - Technical indicators (MA, RSI, Bollinger Bands) - Elliot Wave theory and Fibonacci retracement&nbsp;<br><b>Module 3: Fundamental Analysis -</b> <br>Financial statement analysis (balance sheet, income statement) - Ratio analysis (P/E, P/B, dividend yield) - Industry and market analysis&nbsp;<br><b>Module 4: Portfolio Management -</b> Portfolio construction and management - Asset allocation and diversification - Performance measurement and evaluation<br><b>Module 5: Options and Futures -</b> Introduction to options and futures - Options strategies (buy, sell, spread) - Futures strategies (long, short, spread)<br><b>Module 6: Risk Management -</b> Understanding risk and reward - Diversification and asset allocation - Stop-loss and hedging strategies<br><b>Module 7: Sectoral Analysis -</b> Understanding sectoral trends - Analyzing sectoral performance - Sectoral rotation and its impact&nbsp;<br><b>Module 8: Company Valuation -</b> Methods of company valuation (DCF, P/E, P/B) - Valuation ratios and their interpretation - Company valuation case studies \n<br>ES.<br><b>Module 9: Market Sentiment and Positioning -</b> Understanding market sentiment - Analyzing market positioning - Using sentiment and positioning in trading decisions&nbsp;<br><b>Module 10: Advanced Trading Strategies -</b> Day trading and swing trading strategies - Long-term investing and value investing strategies - News-based trading and event-driven trading strategies This intermediate course content builds on the basics and provides a deeper understanding of the Indian stock market, technical and fundamental analysis, portfolio management, options and futures, risk management, sectoral analysis, company valuation, market sentiment, and advanced trading strategies.&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1-561x374.jpg\" alt data-bs-slide-to=\"3\" data-slide-to=\"3\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Advanced Technical Analysis (Educational Module)</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>₹</b>&nbsp;34989</h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Module 1: Advanced Technical Analysis -</b>&nbsp; Fibonacci retracement - Advanced chart patterns (Triangles, Wedges, Flags) - Technical indicators (MACD, Stochastic, Bollinger Bands)&nbsp;<br><b>Module 2: Advanced Fundamental Analysis -</b> Advanced financial statement analysis (Cash flow statements, ratio analysis) - Industry analysis and competitive analysis - Management analysis and corporate governance&nbsp;<br><b>Module 3: Options and Futures Strategies -</b> Advanced options strategies (Butterfly, Condor, Iron Condor) - Futures strategies (Calendar spreads, Inter-commodity spreads) - Options and futures combination strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 4: Risk Management and Hedging -</b> Advanced risk management techniques (Value at Risk, Stress testing) - Hedging strategies (Delta hedging, Gamma hedging) - Risk management using options and futures&nbsp;<br><b>Module 5: Portfolio Optimization -</b> Advanced portfolio optimization techniques (Black-Litterman model, Risk parity) - Portfolio rebalancing and tax optimization - Performance measurement and evaluation&nbsp;<br><b>Module 6: Advanced Sectoral Analysis -</b> Sectoral rotation and its impact - Sectoral analysis using fundamental and technical analysis - Sectoral investing strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 7: Company Valuation and Modelling -</b> Advanced company valuation methods (DCF, EVA) - Financial modelling using Excel - Company valuation case studies<br><b>Module 8: Market Sentiment and Positioning Analysis -</b> Advanced market sentiment analysis (Sentiment indices, Positioning indicators) - Market positioning analysis (CoT reports, Options data) - Using sentiment and positioning in trading decisions&nbsp;<br><b>Module 9: Advanced Trading Strategies -</b> Advanced day trading and swing trading strategies - Long-term investing and value investing strategies - News-based trading and event-driven trading strategies&nbsp;<br><b>Module 10: Quantitative Analysis and Algorithmic Trading -</b> Introduction to quantitative analysis and algorithmic trading - Using data analysis and back testing - Advanced quantitative strategies (Factor-based investing, Risk parity)&nbsp;<br><b>Module 11: Advanced Topics -</b> Behavioral finance and psychology - Market sentiment and positioning - Advanced risk management techniques - Alternative investment options (real estate, commodities) This comprehensive course content covers all aspects of the Indian stock market, from basics to advanced topics, and provides a solid foundation for investors and traders to build upon<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://rzp.io/l/aRSG020bP\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Enroll Now</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
