          "_name": "header14",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header14\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Wrap</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"cardWidth\" title=\"Wrap Width\" min=\"6\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#393193\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{cardWidth}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Disclaimer &amp; Risk Disclosure</b></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The content provided through this Stock Market &amp; Mutual Fund Training Program by Praveen Singh, Founder – Praveen World Wealth, is for educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended as investment, financial, legal, or tax advice, nor should it be interpreted as a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any financial instruments.<br><br><b>Praveen Singh, Founder – Praveen World</b>, operates as:<br><br><b>• An Authorized Person under a SEBI-registered stockbroker<br>• An AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor under SEBI</b><br><br>We are not SEBI-registered Investment Advisors, and we do not offer personalized financial advice, guaranteed return schemes, or portfolio management services.<br>\n<br>&nbsp;<b>⚠️ Risk Disclosures:</b><br>\n<br>• Stock market investments and trading involve risk. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Prices of securities may fluctuate, and there is no assurance of profit.<br><br>• Leverage, options, and derivatives trading are high-risk strategies and should be undertaken with caution and appropriate risk management.<br><br>• Mutual fund investments are subject to market risks. Please read all scheme-related documents carefully before investing.<br><br>All strategies, case studies, and examples shared in this course are based on personal research, market experience, and general knowledge. You are solely responsible for your own trading and investment decisions. We do not accept liability for any financial loss arising from the use of information provided.<br><br>We recommend consulting a <b>SEBI-registered Investment Advisor for personalized financial advice</b>.<br><br>We wish you a<b> disciplined, informed, and learning-focused trading and investing journey, remembering that outcomes </b>depend on your own knowledge, continuous learning, research, discipline, and risk management.<br><br><b>Warm regards,<br>Praveen Singh<br></b>Founder – Praveen World&nbsp;<br>\n<br><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"index.html#top\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Trading Now</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
